{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"超几何函数"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"超几何函数"},2]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>记 $(a)_n := a (a+1) \\cdots (a+n-1)$ 为上阶乘. <strong>超几何函数</strong>是如下形式幂级数的和:\n$$\r\n{_p}F{_q}\\Big(\r\n    {{a_1,\\cdots,a_p}\\atop {b_1,\\cdots,b_q}};z\r\n\\Big):=\r\n\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\r\n\\frac{\r\n    (a_1)_n\\cdots (a_p)_n\r\n}{\r\n    (b_1)_n\\cdots (b_q)_n\r\n}\\frac{z^n}{n!}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}}